from .core import source,trip
R='Africa'
def sq(k,c):
 source(k,c,R,'https://www.sportquestholidays.com/destinations/'+k+'-fishing/','Sportquest — '+c+' fishing programs','source text inspected in research session',status='text-inspected')
sq('angola','Angola')
trip('angola','Kwanza River mouth','Tarpon;Jack crevalle;African cubera snapper','estuary','Estuary lure and fly expedition','The operator describes tarpon, jacks and snapper fishing around the Kwanza River mouth.','Choose a river-mouth day rather than assuming every departure is offshore. Ask the captain which tide and water clarity suit casting, whether live bait is part of the program, and who supplies bite protection. A compact waterproof day bag matters more than an extra suitcase of unapproved lures.',[11,12,1,2,3],'Operator describes November–March for its tarpon and jacks program; not a forecast or confirmed availability.')
trip('angola','Kwanza coast offshore','Marlin;Sailfish;Yellowfin tuna','offshore','Bluewater charter from the Kwanza coast','The Angola program separately describes offshore fishing for marlin, sailfish and yellowfin tuna.','Ask for a bluewater itinerary and expected running time before comparing prices with river outings. Confirm that trolling outfits, terminal gear and fuel are included. Bring sun protection and a dry layer for the ride rather than buying heavy trolling equipment without speaking to the crew.')
sq('cameroon','Cameroon')
trip('cameroon','Faro River — Gassa Camp','Nile perch;Tigerfish','tropicalriver','Guided freshwater fly expedition','The outfitter describes Gassa Camp on the Faro River as a Nile perch and tigerfish program.','This is a specialized freshwater expedition, not a general safari add-on. Request the current camp access plan and an exact fly-line, leader and hook checklist. Distinguish the setups for the two target groups; a single generic tropical rod recommendation is not enough.')
sq('gabon','Gabon')
trip('gabon','Sette Cama','Tarpon;Jacks;Threadfin','estuary','Lagoon and coastal casting expedition','The operator identifies Sette Cama as a lagoon and coastal lure-and-fly fishing destination.','Decide how much of the trip is shore casting versus fishing from a boat. Ask how the guide handles surf exposure, tackle changes and transfers between areas. Organize tackle by presentation so the day bag can stay light when the plan changes.')
source('port-gentil','Gabon',R,'https://africanwaters.net/2026/02/16/tarpon-fishing-in-port-gentil/','African Waters — Port Gentil tarpon report','turn816099search16')
trip('port-gentil','Port Gentil','Tarpon','estuary','Tarpon-focused guided outing','African Waters published a February 2026 report about tarpon fishing in Port Gentil.','Use the dated report as evidence of a fishing program, not a prediction for your week. Ask which departure point and tide window apply now and whether the recommended approach is bait, lure or fly. Choose terminal tackle only after that method is established.')
sq('guinea-bissau','Guinea-Bissau')
trip('guinea-bissau','Bijagós archipelago','Jacks;Snapper;Barracuda;Grouper','reef','Island reef casting and jigging','The operator describes lure fishing over reefs and wrecks in the Bijagós archipelago.','Request the actual island base and daily boat plan rather than booking an archipelago name alone. Popping and jigging place different demands on rod action and lure storage. Ask which is the main method and bring a limited, guide-approved selection for each.')
sq('madagascar','Madagascar')
trip('madagascar','Nosy Be','Giant trevally;Dogtooth tuna;Grouper','reef','Reef popping and vertical jigging','The Madagascar program describes popping and jigging around Nosy Be reefs, banks and drop-offs.','Have the crew identify whether casting or deep jigging dominates your dates. Select separate surface and vertical outfits only when needed, and confirm airline transport dimensions before buying rod tubes. Keep hooks protected during boat transfers and have a plan for drying tackle between sessions.')
sq('mozambique','Mozambique')
trip('mozambique','Pomene','Giant trevally;Queenfish','coast','Coastal lure fishing from a lodge base','The operator describes shore and boat fishing for trevally and queenfish at Pomene.','Specify whether you want shore sessions, guided boat days or a mixture. Footwear and bag weight depend on that answer. A casting setup should be matched to the lure size and target selected by the guide, not merely labeled as suitable for all saltwater fishing.')
trip('mozambique','Bazaruto archipelago','Black marlin','offshore','Island-based offshore charter','The Mozambique destination guide identifies Bazaruto among its offshore fishing areas and discusses black marlin.','Ask which island or mainland port the charter uses and how long the run to fishing grounds takes. Confirm crew-supplied heavy tackle and whether this is trolling or another method. Keep accommodation transfers separate from fishing-boat inclusions when building the trip budget.')
trip('mozambique','Inhaca Island','','offshore','Island departure and charter planning','The operator lists Inhaca as a Mozambique offshore fishing destination.','Treat this as a location brief until a captain confirms the target and approach. Compare departure logistics, fuel range and equipment provisions before selecting tackle. A day centered on nearshore fishing should not inherit the shopping list for a long-range billfish charter.')
trip('mozambique','Quirimbas archipelago','','reef','Remote island fishing-base selection','The destination program names the Quirimbas among Mozambique fishing areas.','Choose an actual lodge or boat base before making a gear list. Ask the operator to describe the fishing grounds available from that base, transfer arrangements and any weight limit. The archipelago name alone does not establish the right species, rod or season.')
sq('namibia','Namibia')
trip('namibia','Skeleton Coast','Bronze whaler shark','surf','Guided heavy surf fishing','The outfitter offers guided shore fishing for bronze whaler sharks along Namibia’s Skeleton Coast.','Use a specialist guide and clarify bait, casting help and fish-handling responsibilities. Ask whether heavy surf equipment is supplied before buying it. Plan for exposed beach conditions and transport between marks; do not treat a shark-focused surf trip as ordinary light beach spinning.')
sq('tanzania','Tanzania')
for p,camp in [('Mnyera River','Dhala Camp'),('Ruhudji River','Samaki Camp')]:
 trip('tanzania',p,'Tigerfish','tropicalriver','Tigerfish drift-boat fly expedition',f'The operator associates {camp} with guided tigerfish fishing on the {p}.',f'Ask {camp} for the current river-level outlook and the exact boat fishing system. Casting space, hook choice and bite-resistant connections should be agreed before departure. Keep a spare rig accessible and arrange fly boxes for quick changes rather than packing a freshwater trout assortment.',[8,9,10,11],'Operator program is described for early August–November; river conditions and camp operation need reconfirmation.')
source('shangaa','Tanzania',R,'https://www.aardvarkmcleod.com/destinations/','Aardvark McLeod — Shangaa Camp listing','turn702116view0',status='text-inspected')
trip('shangaa','Nyerere Dam — Shangaa Camp','','lake','Reservoir fishing expedition','The outfitter’s destination directory lists Shangaa Camp at Nyerere Dam in Tanzania.','This brief establishes a reservoir program, not a fully researched species calendar. Ask the camp which fish and techniques its current itinerary targets, how far boats travel and what it supplies. Do not borrow a river-only kit from a different Tanzania camp.')
source('uganda','Uganda',R,'https://realmafricasafaris.com/nile-perch-fishing/','Realm Africa — Nile perch fishing','turn148505search3')
for p in ['Ngamba Island — Lake Victoria','Bulago Island — Lake Victoria','Kalangala islands — Lake Victoria']:
 trip('uganda',p,'Nile perch','lake','Lake Victoria guided boat fishing',f'The operator lists {p.split(" — ")[0]} among its Lake Victoria Nile perch fishing areas.','Confirm the actual launch and guide rather than assuming a stay on the lake includes fishing. Ask whether the day involves trolling, casting or bait, and how the crew adapts to wind. Have the operator specify tackle and flotation before purchasing lake-fishing equipment.')
source('murchison','Uganda',R,'https://bucketlistfishingtrips.com/trips/murchison-falls-nile-perch-fishing/','Bucket List Fishing Trips — Murchison Falls','turn148505search25')
trip('murchison','Victoria Nile — Murchison Falls','Nile perch','riverboat','Guided river fishing expedition','The outfitter offers a Murchison Falls Nile perch fishing itinerary.','River access and safe boat positioning belong with the local guide. Ask what bank and boat sessions are included, and get the exact leader and hook requirements. This is not a wading itinerary; pack for guided access and keep electronics in a sealed dry bag.')
source('nxamaseri','Botswana',R,'https://www.highadventurecompany.com/location/botswana-tiger-fishing/','High Adventure Company — Nxamaseri tiger fishing','turn148505search19')
trip('nxamaseri','Nxamaseri — Okavango','Tigerfish','floodplain','Delta-channel tigerfish expedition','The outfitter identifies Nxamaseri Island Lodge as an Okavango tigerfish base.','Ask how the channels accessible from the lodge change with your dates and water levels. Request a boat-based plan and exact fly or lure requirements. Do not assume a delta itinerary means wading; divide fishing clothing from general safari clothing and clarify transfer baggage limits.')
source('zimbabwe','Zimbabwe',R,'https://giltedge.travel/2024/12/10/fishing-in-zimbabwe-guide/','Giltedge — Zimbabwe fishing guide','turn148505search27')
trip('zimbabwe','Lake Kariba','Tigerfish','lake','Tigerfish lake and houseboat planning','The travel operator identifies Lake Kariba as a Zimbabwe tigerfishing destination.','First choose between a day boat, lodge base and houseboat arrangement. Confirm the actual fishing boat and tackle provisions instead of assuming a houseboat package includes a dedicated angling guide. Lake travel, wind exposure and charging facilities should shape the packing plan.')
trip('zimbabwe','Upper Zambezi — Zimbabwe bank','Tigerfish','riverboat','Guided river tigerfish outing','The operator’s Zimbabwe guide includes Zambezi tigerfishing.','Request the precise Zimbabwe-side launch and fishing reach when comparing river packages. A broad river name is not enough to plan transfers or choose a lodge. Establish whether you will cast lures, flies or fish another method before assembling a specialist outfit.')
source('shackletons','Zambia',R,'https://www.fishingwithlarry.com/tiger-fishing-africa-shackletons.html','Fishing With Larry — Shackletons Upper Zambezi','turn148505search29')
trip('shackletons','Mwandi — Upper Zambezi','Tigerfish','riverboat','Upper Zambezi lodge-based fishing','The outfitter describes a Shackletons tigerfish program near Mwandi on the Upper Zambezi.','Keep this itinerary distinct from the Lower Zambezi camps. Ask for current channel access, travel arrangements and the supplied tackle list. Choose compact boat storage and compatible leaders, and leave any optional second rod purchase until the lodge has reviewed what you already own.')
source('nasser','Egypt',R,'https://www.african-angler.net/','African Angler — Lake Nasser safaris','turn816099search1')
trip('nasser','Lake Nasser — Abu Simbel','Nile perch','lake','Multi-day Nile perch boat safari','African Angler describes Lake Nasser fishing safaris and an Abu Simbel base.','Decide between a mobile safari and a fixed base before comparing packing lists. Confirm sleeping arrangements, charging, drinking-water provision and whether shore sessions are included. Match the rod and terminal system to the operator’s lure recommendations rather than buying a general lake combo.')
source('binel','Morocco',R,'https://morocco-carp.com/','Morocco Carp — Bin el Ouidane','turn816099search6')
trip('binel','Bin el Ouidane','Carp','carp','Carp-fishing holiday with equipment rental','The operator offers carp fishing and gear rental at Bin el Ouidane.','Rental can remove the need to fly with bulky carp equipment. Confirm the exact rod, reel, shelter, landing and fish-care equipment included, then buy only missing personal items. Ask about current swim access and water level before booking a long bank session.')
source('gambia','Gambia',R,'https://barracudalodge.com/fishing-in-the-gambia/','Barracuda Lodge — fishing in the Gambia','turn816099search18')
trip('gambia','Barracuda Lodge jetty','','estuary','Lodge-based handlining introduction','The lodge describes jetty handlining as one of its fishing experiences.','For this introductory outing, ask whether tackle and bait are supplied before making any equipment purchase. Confirm the actual jetty access, supervision and session timing with the lodge. A short handlining session needs a different preparation list from a full offshore charter.')
source('senegal','Senegal',R,'https://www.gambia.co.uk/blog/fishing-in-the-gambia','The Gambia Experience — fishing and Saly programs','turn816099search3')
trip('senegal','Saly marina','','offshore','Resort-linked deep-sea fishing inquiry','The tour operator’s fishing article mentions the Saly Fishing Club and Lamantin Beach Resort marina.','Use this as a lead to confirm an active fishing operator, not bookable inventory. Ask which harbor departure and boat are available for your dates, what target they propose and which equipment is included. Do not select heavy tackle based solely on a resort description.')
source('djerba','Tunisia',R,'https://djerbaactivitesdreams.com/','Djerba Activites Dreams — boat fishing excursion','turn295606search8')
trip('djerba','Djerba','','coast','Short equipment-included boat outing','The operator describes a three-hour Djerba fishing excursion with rods, bait and equipment.','This is an introduction rather than a confirmed big-game program. Ask about the launch, trip length and expected technique. Prioritize comfortable deck footwear, sun protection and a waterproof phone pouch; confirm included equipment before buying a rod for a single short outing.')
source('sterkfontein','South Africa',R,'https://www.southafrica.net/','South African Tourism — Sterkfontein Dam fishing','turn295606search9',kind='official-tourism')
trip('sterkfontein','Sterkfontein Dam','Yellowfish','lakebank','Stillwater yellowfish fly fishing','South African Tourism identifies Sterkfontein Dam as a yellowfish fly-fishing destination.','Ask a local guide how they expect you to access the fishing water and what presentation suits the dates. Build the kit around that method rather than importing a trout stocking-lake checklist. Separate bank-walking clothing from any confirmed boat equipment and leave space for a warm layer.')
source('lesotho','Lesotho',R,'https://africanwaters.net/','African Waters — Makhangoa Community Camp','turn295606search6')
trip('lesotho','Bokong River — Makhangoa','','river','Community-camp mountain fly fishing','African Waters describes Makhangoa Community Camp on the Bokong River above Katse Dam.','Obtain the camp’s date-specific target and tackle list before deciding on a rod. River levels, bank walking and daily beat allocation affect preparation. Check the guide’s footwear advice and transfer baggage limits; pack a mountain-weather layer even when the wider trip includes warmer lowland destinations.')
